From c548a8de28ab71524b396047c32cf745b1f455c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:28:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] The API can talk to Hookline for an agency: its address,
 token and webhook secret sealed in the database, a closed set of calls on
 connections of its own with short timeouts and a 5 s rest after a failed
 connection, each account filtered by the model it is tied to (kept a minute),
 and its signed webhooks turned into notifications for the admins and the
 model's people.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
